# Face match: officer1 (enrolled face s3) presents another live person (s1). Liveness passes after challenges, the
# SFace SDK score is below the threshold and the client answers "Face match not found"; the right face then logs
# in. Run last: failed liveness attempts here could block officer1's face login for the lock period.
label face match: live but wrong person refused, right person accepted
menu Logout
wait-node #userId 60
source s1-main
follow s1
login ${OFFICER} ${OFFICER_PASSWORD}
mark
expect-live 120
follow off
expect-alert Face match not found 30
snap login-wrong-person
# The liveness window closes a moment after its pass; Submit on the login page works again only then.
wait-gone Face verification 15
source ${OFFICER_FACE}-main
follow ${OFFICER_FACE}
click text=Submit
expect-live 90
follow off
expect Operational Tasks 90
